2. In the **branch view** of the **map editor** *- orange rectangle*

3. Scroll down to the step whose file you want to open. *- red rectangle*

3. Click it to open the step in the **lens**. *- purple rectangle*

4. Scroll down the lens until you can see the **Instructions** section. *- blue rectangle*

5. Click the **Open in markdown editor** button. *- blue rectangle*

{{::il.DA_OpenStepFile_FromLens_img}}


6. The step file opens to the side in the markdown editor

{{::il.DA_OpenStepFile_img}}

